    "info": {
        "title": "HC Advocate Bar Reg API",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "description": "API provides list of cases from a High court establishment for a given Advocate Registration number. Input for this API is Establishment Code, Advocate\u2019s Bar Registration Year, Case Registration Year, Status of the Case (Pending or Disposed) and other details. The Advocate may be petitioner\u2019s advocate or respondent\u2019s advocate or an extra party advocate. The search string for advocate bar registration number shall be input in the format state characters-bar registration number\u2013registration year."
    },
